ksx — third-party material vendored into this repository
========================================================

ksx itself is dual-licensed MIT OR Apache-2.0 (LICENSE-MIT, LICENSE-APACHE).
The entries below cover material by other authors that is COPIED INTO this
tree — art traced or embedded into ksx's own files, and source vendored under
`crates/`. Ordinary crates.io dependencies are not listed here; their licenses
travel with them in `Cargo.lock` and in the registry.

Each entry says what was taken, where it now lives, and what the license asks
for. If you cut a new asset from one of these sources, extend the entry — a
NOTICE that has to be reconstructed from `git log` is not a NOTICE.


