2. Gamepad-Asset-Pack by AL2009man (MIT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Upstream: https://github.com/AL2009man/Gamepad-Asset-Pack
    License:  MIT
    Used in:  studio-ui/art/src-xboxseries.svg   (upstream, byte-identical)
              studio-ui/art/src-ds4.svg          (upstream, byte-identical)
              crates/ksx-studio/assets/pad-xbox.svg   (recoloured build output)
              crates/ksx-studio/assets/pad-ds4.svg    (recoloured build output)

The controller drawings ksx Studio renders — the status page's pad tiles and
the `/map` mapper stage. `studio-ui/build.mjs` strips editor metadata and
recolours them to the Studio palette; the geometry is upstream's.

Per the pack's credit request, both Studio pages carry a visible footer line
("controller art: Gamepad-Asset-Pack (MIT) by AL2009man"), pinned by a test
in `crates/ksx-studio/src/render.rs`. See `studio-ui/art/README.md` for the
per-file provenance and the trade-dress note.


