3. vigem-client by Casper (CasualX) (MIT)
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

    Upstream: https://github.com/CasualX/vigem-client
    License:  MIT — full text in crates/vigem-client/license.txt
    Used in:  crates/vigem-client/   (vendored source, a workspace member)

The user-mode client for the ViGEmBus virtual-pad driver. Vendored rather
than depended on because ksx needs two of its unstable features
(`unstable_xtarget_notification`, `unstable_ds4`); it is excluded from the
workspace's default members because its integration tests require the driver.
